  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large cazuela over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saut\u00049 until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and saut\u00049 for another minute.",
    "Add the deep-fried tofu and cook until lightly browned.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the canned chickpeas, tomato paste, and 2 cups of water. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the stew to a simmer and cook for 20 minutes or until the flavors have melded together.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
